          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 17h2a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v4a2 2 0 002 2h2m2 4h6a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2H9a2 2 0 00-2 2v4a2 2 0 002 2zm8-12V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H9a2 2 0 00-2 2v4h10z"/></svg>
          Imprimir / Guardar PDF
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Brand Header -->
    <header class="p-6 sm:p-10 border-b border-slate-100 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-50/70 to-white">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
        
        <!-- Logo Recreated with exact Brand Identity & Geometry -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <!-- Smartphone Graphic Icon -->
            <div class="w-12 h-20 sm:w-14 sm:h-24 bg-brand-blue rounded-xl p-1 shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between shrink-0">
              <div class="w-full flex justify-center py-0.5">
                <div class="w-4 h-1 bg-white/40 rounded-full"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="w-full h-full bg-brand-green rounded-md flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden">
                <!-- Chat Bubble with Dollar -->
                <div class="bg-white rounded-full p-1.5 sm:p-2 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center transform -rotate-3">
                  <span class="text-brand-blue font-black text-sm sm:text-base leading-none">$</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="w-full flex justify-center py-0.5">
                <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full border border-white/60"></div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Typography Wordmark -->
            <div>
              <div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight font-display flex items-baseline">
                <span class="text-brand-blue">Sale</span>
                <span class="text-brand-green ml-0.5">vale</span>
              </div>
              <!-- Divider line & Slogan -->
              <div class="w-full h-1 bg-brand-green rounded-full my-1"></div>
              <div class="text-brand-blue font-bold tracking-tight text-lg sm:text-xl font-display flex items-center gap-1">
                <span>lo vale.</span>
                <span class="text-[9px] align-super border border-brand-blue/60 rounded-full px-0.5 py-0.2">®</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Header Titles -->
        <div class="text-center md:text-right">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-blueLight text-brand-blue font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-blue"></span>
            Guía Oficial para Gerentes de Sucursal
          </div>
          <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 font-display leading-tight">
            Proceso de Reembolso: <span class="text-brand-blue">Microperforado</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs sm:text-sm mt-1 max-w-md">
            Departamento de Mercadotecnia & Operaciones Administrativas
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Objective Highlight Banner -->
      <div class="mt-8 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-blueLight via-white to-brand-greenLight rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5 border border-slate-200 flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-brand-blue text-white flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-sm mt-0.5">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm sm:text-base font-display">Objetivo del Procedimiento</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">
            Establecer con claridad el flujo de trabajo, los responsables, la documentación obligatoria y los tiempos de dispersión para la colocación e instalación de microperforados en sucursales, garantizando agilidad y transparencia financiera.
          </p>

          <!-- Nota Importante: Presupuesto Tope -->
          <div class="mt-3.5 flex items-center gap-3 p-3 bg-amber-500/10 border-2 border-amber-500/40 rounded-xl text-amber-900">
            <span class="flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-amber-500 text-white font-bold text-sm shrink-0">!</span>
            <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm">
              <strong class="font-black text-amber-950 uppercase tracking-wide">Nota Importante:</strong>
              <span class="ml-1 text-slate-800 font-medium">El presupuesto tope autorizado para la instalación es de <strong class="text-brand-blue font-extrabold text-sm sm:text-base underline decoration-brand-green">$3,000 MXN</strong> con impuestos incluidos.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Process Steps Section -->
    <main class="p-6 sm:p-10 bg-slate-50/50">
      
      <!-- Interactive Modality Selector (Reembolso vs Anticipo) -->
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">
        <span class="text-brand-green font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest">Modalidades Disponibles</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 font-display mt-1">
          Flujo Operativo de Sucursal
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs sm:text-sm mt-1">
          Selecciona la vía asignada para tu trámite y sigue la secuencia de 4 pasos.
        </p>

        <!-- Toggle Pill Buttons -->
        <div class="no-print mt-6 inline-flex p-1.5 bg-slate-200/80 rounded-2xl gap-2 shadow-inner border border-slate-300">
          <button id="btnTabReembolso" onclick="switchModality('reembolso')" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-display font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm transition-all shadow-sm bg-brand-blue text-white">
            Opción 1: Reembolso Posterior
          </button>
          <button id="btnTabAnticipo" onclick="switchModality('anticipo')" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-display font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm transition-all text-slate-700 hover:text-slate-900">
            Opción 2: Anticipo - Comprobación
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- MODALITY 1: REEMBOLSO -->
      <div id="flowReembolso" class="flow-container">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-6">
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-brand-blue"></span>
          <h3 class="font-display font-extrabold text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-900">
            Flujo de 4 Pasos para tu <span class="text-brand-blue">Reembolso</span>
          </h3>
          <span class="text-xs bg-brand-blueLight text-brand-blue px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold ml-auto">Pago realizado por Gerente</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Steps Grid Reembolso -->
        <div class="relative grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">

          <!-- STEP 1 -->
          <div class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-card-hover transition-all duration-300 relative flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div class="absolute -top-3 left-6 px-3 py-0.5 bg-brand-blue text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider shadow">
              Paso 01
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-blueLight text-brand-blue flex items-center justify-center mb-4 mt-2">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 font-display">Validación de Mercadotecnia</h4>
              <span class="inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-brand-blue bg-brand-blueLight px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md mt-1 mb-3">
                Responsable: Gerente & MKT
              </span>
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed">
                Se debe compartir la <strong>cotización</strong> con el <strong>monto total e impuestos desglosados</strong> a las encargadas de MKT para su formal autorización previa.
              </p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-medium text-amber-800 bg-amber-50 rounded-lg p-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 text-amber-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/></svg>
              <span>Tope máximo: $3,000 con impuestos.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- STEP 2 -->
          <div class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-card-hover transition-all duration-300 relative flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div class="absolute -top-3 left-6 px-3 py-0.5 bg-brand-green text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider shadow">
              Paso 02
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-greenLight text-brand-green flex items-center justify-center mb-4 mt-2">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 10h18M7 15h1m4 0h1m-7 4h12a3 3 0 003-3V8a3 3 0 00-3-3H6a3 3 0 00-3 3v8a3 3 0 003 3z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 font-display">Pago del Servicio</h4>
              <span class="inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-brand-greenDark bg-brand-greenLight px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md mt-1 mb-3">
                Responsable: Gerente de Sucursal
              </span>
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed">
                El Gerente realiza el pago correspondiente y solicita de forma obligatoria la factura emitida formalmente a nombre de:
              </p>
              <div class="mt-3 p-2 bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-xl text-center shadow-inner">
                <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 block uppercase font-mono tracking-wider">Razón Social Requerida:</span>
                <span class="text-sm font-black tracking-wider text-green-400 font-mono">SAVAPRE</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-medium text-slate-600 bg-slate-100 rounded-lg p-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 text-slate-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
              <span>Sin excepciones de facturación.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- STEP 3 -->
          <div class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-card-hover transition-all duration-300 relative flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div class="absolute -top-3 left-6 px-3 py-0.5 bg-brand-blue text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider shadow">
              Paso 03
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-blueLight text-brand-blue flex items-center justify-center mb-4 mt-2">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 font-display">Solicitud de Reembolso</h4>
              <span class="inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-brand-blue bg-brand-blueLight px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md mt-1 mb-3">
                Responsable: Gerente de Sucursal
              </span>
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed">
                El Gerente comparte vía correo electrónico, <strong>sobre el mismo Vo.Bo. de MKT</strong>, la factura del pago adjuntando ambos archivos:
              </p>
              <div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-center text-xs font-bold">
                <div class="p-1.5 border border-red-200 bg-red-50 text-red-700 rounded-lg">
                  📄 PDF
                </div>
                <div class="p-1.5 border border-blue-200 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 rounded-lg">
                  📑 XML
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-medium text-brand-blue bg-brand-blueLight rounded-lg p-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 text-brand-blue" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15.172 7l-6.586 6.586a2 2 0 102.828 2.828l6.414-6.586a4 4 0 00-5.656-5.656l-6.415 6.585a6 6 0 108.486 8.486L20.5 13"/></svg>
              <span>Asunto: Microperforado - &lt;Sucursal&gt;</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- STEP 4 -->
          <div class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-card-hover transition-all duration-300 relative flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div class="absolute -top-3 left-6 px-3 py-0.5 bg-brand-green text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider shadow">
              Paso 04
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-greenLight text-brand-green flex items-center justify-center mb-4 mt-2">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 font-display">Gestión de Reembolso</h4>
              <span class="inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-brand-greenDark bg-brand-greenLight px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md mt-1 mb-3">
                Responsable: Administración
              </span>
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed">
                Administrativamente y con la factura validada se realiza el reembolso directo a cuenta de la sucursal/gerente.
              </p>
              <div class="mt-3 p-2.5 bg-brand-greenLight border border-brand-green/30 rounded-xl text-center">
                <span class="text-[10px] text-brand-greenDark block uppercase font-bold tracking-wider">Tiempo Estimado:</span>
                <span class="text-sm font-extrabold text-brand-greenDark">3 a 4 Días Hábiles</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-medium text-slate-700 bg-slate-100 rounded-lg p-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 text-brand-green" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
              <span>Días de pago: Lun • Mié • Vie</span>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- MODALITY 2: ANTICIPO - COMPROBACIÓN -->
      <div id="flowAnticipo" class="flow-container hidden">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-6">
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-brand-green"></span>
          <h3 class="font-display font-extrabold text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-900">
            Flujo de 4 Pasos para tu <span class="text-brand-greenDark">Anticipo-Comprobación</span>
          </h3>
          <span class="text-xs bg-brand-greenLight text-brand-greenDark px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold ml-auto">Fondeo previo corporativo</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Steps Grid Anticipo -->
        <div class="relative grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">

          <!-- STEP 1 ANTICIPO -->
          <div class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-card-hover transition-all duration-300 relative flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div class="absolute -top-3 left-6 px-3 py-0.5 bg-brand-blue text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider shadow">
              Paso 01
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-blueLight text-brand-blue flex items-center justify-center mb-4 mt-2">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 font-display">Validación de Mercadotecnia</h4>
              <span class="inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-brand-blue bg-brand-blueLight px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md mt-1 mb-3">
                Responsable: Gerente & MKT
              </span>
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed">
                Se debe compartir una <strong>Cotización</strong> con el <strong>Monto total e impuesto</strong> a las encargadas de MKT para su autorización formal.
              </p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-medium text-amber-800 bg-amber-50 rounded-lg p-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 text-amber-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/></svg>
              <span>Presupuesto tope: $3,000 con impuestos.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- STEP 2 ANTICIPO -->
          <div class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-card-hover transition-all duration-300 relative flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div class="absolute -top-3 left-6 px-3 py-0.5 bg-brand-green text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider shadow">
              Paso 02
            </div>
